<title>USA: TSI buys German instrument maker.</title>
<headline>TSI buys German instrument maker.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>TSI Inc said Wednesday it acquired the assets of Zimmer GmbHz, a German company that develops and manufactures non-contact instruments for industrial quality and process monitoring.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Zimmer's 1995 sales were $1.8 million.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
